  ]

  #sol-item(22, "A", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    A clerk may enter invoices but not post to the bank.
  ]

  #sol-item(23, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    A copy on the same disk is lost with the disk.
  ]

  #sol-item(24, "A", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    It is a property of double entry, not a proof of accuracy.
  ]

  #sol-item(25, "B", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    The entry is double and valid; only a review of the coding finds it.
  ]

  #sol-item(26, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    Posting, arithmetic and report generation are faster and arithmetically exact.
  ]

  #sol-item(27, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    The initial and continuing costs are real, especially for a small firm.
  ]

  #sol-item(28, "A", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
